    "prompt": "A locked medium anime shot observes one continuous seven-second handoff. The long-haired auburn woman on screen-left, wearing her black top with purple-striped sleeves and blue jeans, begins holding the pictured single cardboard box of records from underneath. The short-haired woman on screen-right in her mustard winter coat and charcoal scarf brings both open hands under that same box. The long-haired woman moves the box a short distance toward her; they briefly share its weight, then the sister secures it against her own torso. Only after the sister supports the weight, the long-haired woman releases her grip and lowers both empty hands naturally beside her thighs. The sister makes a small balancing adjustment with the box while the long-haired woman exhales with lowered eyes and settles her shoulders. The original ordered record sleeves remain upright inside the box through the transfer. Both women stay in their pictured places, with natural torso and arm weight shifts. The warm lamplight, emptied wooden shelf, open doorway and snowy blue evening stay steady. The sound is quiet room tone.",
